recall: undoes a folder pointer cut between entries, or listing fewer files than its folder, pushes as a smaller folder (found after the stories).
fix: acdaf8d (#111); before the fix: a6193a6.
validated: with this patch on HEAD, tests/test_push_journey.py::test_a_folder_pointer_shorter_than_its_folder_stops_the_push_before_upload goes red.

diff --git a/src/mintd/data_ops.py b/src/mintd/data_ops.py
